@startuml
title Canonical Interlanguage Bridge
left to right direction
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif

rectangle "Source value\nRholang Par or guest value" as Source #DBEAFE
rectangle "Bridge signature\ncanonical BridgeType T" as Sig #FEF3C7
rectangle "Source codec\nto Canon(T)" as Decode #FDE68A
rectangle "Canonical value\nloss-rejecting domain" as Canon #DCFCE7
rectangle "Target type profile\nruntime representation" as Profile #EDE9FE
rectangle "Target runtime value\nparameter or result" as Runtime #CCFBF1
rectangle "Runtime step\ndeterministic effects" as Step #EDE9FE
rectangle "Return codec\nfrom profile to Canon(T)" as ReturnCodec #FDE68A
rectangle "Rholang result\nPar" as Result #DBEAFE
rectangle "Bridge error\nfail closed" as Error #FEE2E2

Source --> Sig : value plus declared type
Sig --> Decode : choose codec
Decode --> Canon : decode and validate
Decode -[#DC2626,dashed]-> Error : invalid source
Canon --> Profile : select representation
Profile --> Runtime : encode for target
Profile -[#DC2626,dashed]-> Error : unsupported policy
Runtime --> Step : evaluate
Step --> ReturnCodec : runtime result
ReturnCodec --> Result : validate and encode Par
ReturnCodec -[#DC2626,dashed]-> Error : invalid result

legend right
  |= Color |= Concept |
  |<#DBEAFE> | Language boundary |
  |<#FEF3C7> | Bridge contract |
  |<#FDE68A> | Codecs and validation |
  |<#DCFCE7> | Canonical value |
  |<#EDE9FE> | Runtime profile / step |
  |<#CCFBF1> | Runtime value |
  |<#FEE2E2> | Deterministic error |
endlegend
@enduml
